WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.950
Jamie starts raw Rush after the corner heavy-Bakkai knockdown.

2
00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:01.600
The Rush overhead hits Ryu at the corner.

3
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:02.050
Crouching medium punch links from the overhead.

4
00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:03.550
OD Swagger Step launches Ryu.

5
00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:04.450
The sweep target’s kick follow-up continues the juggle.

6
00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:06.200
The punch follow-up drinks after the sweep target.
